        "question": "What is the process to hire a maid ?",
        "answer": "First, you browse our candidates or send us your requirements. We match you with suitable profiles. You interview them (online or offline), and once you choose, we handle the contract and medical screening."
    },
    {
        "question": "Is there a guarantee?",
        "answer": "Yes, we provide a replacement guarantee within the first 3 months if the helper is not a good fit or resigns."
    },
    {
        "question": "How long does it take?",
        "answer": "Typically 3-5 days for local candidates. For candidates from other islands, it might take 1-2 weeks."
    },
    {
        "question": "What are the fees involved?",
        "answer": "We charge an agency fee which covers recruitment, background checks, medical checkups, and administration. Please visit our Price & Process page for details."
    }
]

